{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Badminton</strong> brings the speed, precision, and energy of real-world badminton to life. Experience the fastest racket sport in the world like never before, in a realistic and accessible game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff8 REALISTIC GAMEPLAY &amp; PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic shuttle physics</strong> and <strong>realistic</strong>\u00a0<strong>player animations</strong> recreate the flow and intensity of real matches.\u00a0Expect a challenge that feels natural, with performance shaped by positioning, timing, and shot selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 CAREER MODE: BUILD YOUR JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from the bottom and rise through a full career mode, competing in the <strong>world biggest tournaments</strong>. <strong>Train, improve, and climb a ranking</strong> system inspired by real-world competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your playstyle naturally: your skills evolve based on how you train and compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc65 LOCAL MULTIPLAYER (UP TO 4 PLAYERS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play singles or doubles with your friends.\u00a0Pure Badminton supports local <strong>multiplayer</strong> for <strong>up to 4 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a competitive player or a lifelong fan, it\u2019s time to bring your skills to the digital court.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2591310?t=1756914800","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/04017a04812de7386de359b015efff229373bb77/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756914800","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/787bf7aad8e20df6af755f2b4c64ed2ec6b26c19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756914800","capsul